DESCRIPTION:NOTICE OF EXECUTIVE COMMITTEE\n\nOF THE MONROE COUNTY PLAN COMM
 ISSION\n\n \n\nPlease take notice that the Executive Committee of the Monr
 oe County Plan Commission will meet Monday July 27\, 2026\, at 9:00 AM via
  a hybrid meeting in Room 106D\, North Showers Building Government Center\
 , 501 N Morton St\, Bloomington\, IN 47404 and via Microsoft Teams Linked 
 here: https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/29887771447627?p=82m0ahyHtljZRxVNKk
  or use the Teams App Meeting ID: 298 877 714 476 27 Passcode: pg39Dm9T\n\
 nIf calling in\, dial +1 (872) 242-9432 and enter phone conference ID: 134
 535248#. Once you're connected\, dial 1 to join the meeting.\n\nLearn more
  about how to access Teams: https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/office/joi
 n-a-meeting-in-microsoft-teams-1613bb53-f3fa-431e-85a9-d6a91e3468c9?ui=en-
 us&rs=en-us&ad=us\n\nThe meeting will be held for the following purpose:\n
 \n \n\nDiscussion regarding the draft Planning budget for 2027\n\nThis mee
 ting is open to the public. This is not a public hearing. The meeting is s
 cheduled for 9:00 AM to 10:30 AM.\n\n \n\nPosted this 22nd day of July 202
 6 at 4:20 PM by Jackie N. Jelen\, Director\, Monroe County Planning Depart
 ment.\n\n \n\nFor more information\, contact:\n\n \n\nJackie N. Jelen\, AI
 CP\n\nDirector\n\nMonroe County Planning Department\n\n501 N. Morton St.\,
  Suite 224\n\nBloomington\, IN 47404\n\njnester@co.monroe.in.us\n\nPhone: 
 (812) 349-2560
GEO:39.170848;-86.537385
LOCATION:Room 106D\, North Showers Building 
SUMMARY: The Executive Committee of the Monroe County Plan Commission 
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.in.gov/event/the-executive-committee-of-the-mo
 nroe-county-plan-commission
CATEGORIES:Events
END:VEVENT
